msgid "Using OpenTelemetry"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This guide explains how your Quarkus application can utilize https://"
"opentelemetry.io/[OpenTelemetry] to provide\n"
"distributed tracing for interactive web applications."
msgstr ""

